  "description": "High Performance Folding Electric Bike\nThe Sierra GT Folding Fat Tire pumps up the ability and looks of our standard Sierra Folding Fat Tire bike.\nThe Sierra GT folding fat tire bike combines all the great features of the standard Sierra model with upgraded Bafang Mag Wheels, a Bafang 750 Watt (995 Peak) Motor, RST Guide Front Shocks, Tektro Auriga E-Comp Hydraulic Brakes, Upgraded Bigstone 600E Display, and upgraded Shimano 8 Speed Acera derailleur.\nThe Sierra GT brings rough and tough, off-road, and folding capabilities to our lineup., Great for the RV, camping, trail riding, as well as the beach or boardwalk. These bikes go anywhere and can be stored almost anywhere. Easily fitting in the back of your car or truck, it only takes seconds to launch for hours of fun. Optional NCX Suspension Seat Post & Serfas Gel Seat upgrade can be added for an additional $179.\nCome check out the E-Lux Sierra GT Folding Electric Bike today and ride the difference!\n\nDisplay: Bigstone Backlit LCD Display w/ USB Charger, MPH, Voltage, Battery Range, Ride Time & Odometer\n\nIf your color is not available please call to check backorder availability.\nELUX_SSFT",
